# DashCharging (system_app) toggles fast reverse charging. The on/off switch goes
# through the MiCharge HAL, but the tier-gate consent flag revchg_bcl is not exposed
# by the HAL, so the app reads otg_enable and writes revchg_bcl directly.

# The retained stock vendor policy owns this type. Redeclare it bare so this module
# can express the client rules: adding the sysfs_type/file_type attributes here would
# expand init/vendor_init's broad attribute-based dir allows onto this type and trip
# the domain->sysfs_type dir-write neverallow during the checked compile.
type sysfs_usb_supply;

allow system_app sysfs_usb_supply:file { getattr open read write };
